++            "text": "/* Research Lab Tab Label Fix */\n/* Ensure tab labels are always visible */\n/* Scope Research Lab tab label fixes to the Research Lab pane only so global\n   .nav-link rules don't affect the main dashboard navigation. */\n#tab-pane-research_lab .nav-link {\n    display: inline-block !important;\n    visibility: visible !important;\n    opacity: 1 !important;\n    color: #adb5bd !important;\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem !important;\n    min-width: 100px !important;\n}\n\n#tab-pane-research_lab .nav-link:not(:empty) {\n    /* Tab has content */\n    font-size: 1rem !important;\n}\n\n/* Active tab styling */\n#tab-pane-research_lab .nav-link.active,\n#tab-pane-research_lab .nav-link[aria-selected=\"true\"] {\n    color: #00bc8c !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    background-color: #2b3035 !important;\n}\n\n/* Ensure tab content is visible when active (scoped) */\n#tab-pane-research_lab .tab-pane {\n    padding: 1rem !important;\n}\n\n#tab-pane-research_lab .tab-pane.active {\n    display: block !important;\n}\n\n/* If specific tab ordering is required for Research Lab, add rules here. */\n/* If specific tab ordering is required for Research Lab, add rules here. */\n"
